<section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-xl border border-flexline-border bg-white p-5 shadow-card">
  <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-flexline-navy">Verification playbook (edge cases)</h2>
  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Design handles the situations below so this screen can ship as the final borrower experience.</p>
  <dl class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm text-flexline-navy">
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Duplicate account</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Same routing + account cannot be added twice for your company; you will see a clear error and keep your existing record.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Name does not match bank records</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Legal name is validated at payout time in operations; mismatches are caught before money moves—fix the name or add the correct account.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Plaid unavailable or bank not listed</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Use <strong>Switch to micro-deposits</strong> on the Plaid step; routing and account you already entered are reused.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Micro-deposits delayed or on the wrong account</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Copy explains typical timing; users confirm checking vs savings selection; after <%= BankAccount::MICRO_DEPOSIT_EXPIRY_DAYS %> days the attempt expires and must be restarted.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Wrong micro amounts (<%= BankAccount::MICRO_DEPOSIT_MAX_ATTEMPTS %> tries)</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Each miss is counted; after the limit, status is <strong>Failed</strong> with support guidance—restart verification from scratch.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Verified account needs to change</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Routing and account numbers cannot be edited in place after verification; add a new account, verify it, then use it for draws.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Draw blocked until verified</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Draw form only lists verified accounts; ops and future automation will not disburse to any other state.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Abandon or “clear and start over”</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">If there is no draw history on that bank record, the portal removes it so you are not blocked by a half-finished duplicate fingerprint.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Non-US or non-ACH institutions</dt>
      <dd class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-flexline-muted">Form copy limits to US ACH; unsupported rails surface as validation or Plaid errors, then micro-deposit path if applicable.</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</section>
